  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DT Institute-Building Inclusive Peace in Sudan (BIPS)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DT Institute-Building Inclusive Peace in Sudan (BIPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Strengthening the capacity of community stakeholders, and youth in particular, to promote peace, and

2) Increasing engagement of communities, and youth in particular, in locally led peacebuilding activities that enhance trust, mutual understanding, and respect.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building the capacity of youth, including young women, and community stakeholders such as local religious, tribal, and community leaders, herders and farmers, and others in Darfur, Blue Nile State, and South Kordofan to work together to identify and address community vulnerabilities to conflict through community action planning and small grants activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bygga kapaciteten hos ungdomar, inklusive unga kvinnor, och samh&#xe4;llsakt&#xf6;rer som lokala religi&#xf6;sa, stam- och samh&#xe4;llsledare, herdar och b&#xf6;nder och andra i Darfur, Blue Nile State och South Kordofan att arbeta tillsammans f&#xf6;r att identifiera och ta itu med samh&#xe4;llets s&#xe5;rbarheter f&#xf6;r konflikt genom samh&#xe4;llsplanering och sm&#xe5; bidragsaktiviteter.</narrative>
  </description>
